  "description": "Baek Ji-young enrolls in a newly established high school to reset her social circle. However, rumors from middle school about her being a spoiled princess and playing mind games follow her, leaving her unable to make a single friend even after a month. Feeling a sense of kinship with Yoo Ji-woo, who is also surrounded by rumors, she hopes they can become friends, but she gives up when she sees Ji-woo putting up a wall against everyone in the class. Then, Ji-woo rapidly closes the distance between them… \n\nAs Ji-young gets closer to Ji-woo, rumors that they are dating spread, plunging her into a whirlwind of relationships. To the confused Ji-young, Ji-woo approaches her as more than just a friend, despite having said they were just friends. \n\n\"Can we really stay friends?\"\n\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69324433), [Daum](https://webtoon.kakao.com/content/%EC%B9%9C%EA%B5%AC%EB%9D%BC%EA%B3%A0-%ED%95%98%EA%B8%B0%EC%97%90%EB%8A%94/4851)",
